# .gitignore — Fathom pen.
#
# Submoduleless by design: product checkouts live under products/ as peer
# standalone clones and are NEVER tracked by this repo. No gitlinks (mode
# 160000), no nested .git pollution in the index.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
!mise.toml
!AGENTS.md
!bin/
!bin/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!products.registry.json

# Large downloadable sample packs & working assets — REFERENCED-NOT-OWNED.
# These are re-downloadable binaries (1.7 GB+ across BVKER/Tisoki/XLNTSOUND)
# kept on disk for the audio products to use; they must never enter git.
samples/
records/
archive/

# Keys & secrets — never commit
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.keyring
*.secret
.env
.env.*
!*.example
